    "title": "\"Family is...Complicated\" -  Clair Obscur : Expedition 33 Maelle Wallpaper [2K] [HDR]",
    "description": "Wallpaper from the upcoming GOTY.\r\n\r\nThis is a tribute to this game, which I finished a few months ago and which is my favorite to date. Whether it's the characters or the soundtrack, I've never experienced anything like it while playing a video game. Thank you so much, Sandfall Interactive, for proving that we're still capable of producing masterpieces.\r\n\r\n-------------\r\n\r\nBelow are the elements used to create this wallpaper.\r\n\r\nBackground: From the ArtStation link by Carla Devèze, Lead Environment Artist at Sandfall Interactive. Please go visit it; it's full of masterpieces: https://www.artstation.com/carleaf\r\n\r\nMaelle: comes from @TheAndyTuman on Twitter: https://x.com/TheAndyTuman/status/1919968736578035731\r\n\r\nAs for the character renders, I found them all over the place, so I couldn't list them all. However, I also invite you to visit the ArtStation of Reynaud Alan, Lead Character Artist at Sandfall Interactive: https://www.artstation.com/reynaudalan\r\n\r\n-------------\r\n\r\nSoundtrack (By Lorien Testard, Alice Duport-Percier & Victor Borba)\r\n\r\nClair Obscur: Expedition 33 - We are Expedition 33 (Original Soundtrack) - Reveal Trailer Music : https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SfIn0NrDAvE\r\n\r\nAlicia: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p00EF6_b5pI\r\n\r\nMaelle: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PZ4DHDX-pQk\r\n\r\nAlicia (Music Box): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=z21eD44zKD8\r\n\r\nPoème d'Amour : https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Mo8OvFEdxGA\r\n\r\nUne vie à t'aimer (Nos Vies en Lumière Edition) : https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dWGEIen49MI\r\n\r\nUne vie à Peindre (In Game Version): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZnfuZg28qYo\r\n\r\nAline: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vGVeDm4118Q\r\n\r\nMonoco's Station - Tics Tacs : https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pBZ_alUjfZo\r\n\r\nAux lendemains non écrits: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f1y_fUVMOHQ\r\n\r\n(I'm probably forgetting some, I absolutely love all the game's soundtracks and it was really hard to choose lol)\r\n\r\n-------------\r\n\r\nTags :\r\n\r\nClair Obscur, Expedition 33, Sandfall Interactive, Maelle, Alicia, Gustave, Verso, Lune, Sciel, Renoir, Aline, Clea, Paintress, Curator, Dessendre, Landscape, Art, Canvas\r\n\r\n\r\nPour Ceux Qui Viendront Après | For Those Who Comes After",
